{"steam_appid":3486530,"steam_name":"Stupid Never Dies","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3486530/1929990323/90624d120cbb87fb3a5e0fc35c2a9f804d19d575/1791587259/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791853294","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257454969/85366157efb400ef0c2479489bc508ea6f5c0afe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791853294","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/0aa754881b53510afaac99d7b3e0cf1f1e56472f/ss_0aa754881b53510afaac99d7b3e0cf1f1e56472f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792722824","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/c0087ac8fdf7868e9d83d386116d1ef780c14685/ss_c0087ac8fdf7868e9d83d386116d1ef780c14685.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792722824","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/2babd4574824e1d23b528965507a3b6fd58f938b/ss_2babd4574824e1d23b528965507a3b6fd58f938b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792722824","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/bb98303b3be6568674ce781c48a8b11cf23fd578/ss_bb98303b3be6568674ce781c48a8b11cf23fd578.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792722824","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/54495915c6d7e0a6069ded0b1700eec0fe6bc211/ss_54495915c6d7e0a6069ded0b1700eec0fe6bc211.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792722824"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/aeb11fcdbdf811c7bf9e869e243cc698.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Davy, the weakest zombie imaginable, and battle through a mysterious dungeon to defeat KOM, the King of Monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dive makes Davy grow stronger faster. Customize his body, devour powerful monsters, steal their abilities, and race against time to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by GPTRACK50, a studio founded by veteran action game developers, Stupid Never Dies is a unique single-player 3D action RPG combining fast-paced growth, bizarre humor, and stylish action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/e84b4d7c99a08f0540937ba3ff9c966c.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/e84b4d7c99a08f0540937ba3ff9c966c.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/e84b4d7c99a08f0540937ba3ff9c966c.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/4d651f43790a133e9bf87ad409e090f9.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Davy, a timid zombie, falls in love at first sight with Julia, a college girl frozen to death during the Great War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bring her back to life, he must defeat KOM, recover humanity’s lost knowledge, and survive the dungeon’s deadly depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the weakest zombie save the girl he loves—and maybe the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/53ab941ed4a36bd1ff96fbb7da233b15.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/53ab941ed4a36bd1ff96fbb7da233b15.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/53ab941ed4a36bd1ff96fbb7da233b15.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/3e0e0f3f08c152583c8d31e748d23b8c.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/a5c898b06d0ae0ae46cab0bd305f203f.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat elite monsters, consume their cores, and steal their powers. Transform into 11 unique Styles, including Werewolf, Harpy, Golem, Vampire, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/cedfe1b4c3ed1a6f3ad5bf7c3be869c8.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/cedfe1b4c3ed1a6f3ad5bf7c3be869c8.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/cedfe1b4c3ed1a6f3ad5bf7c3be869c8.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/ad7b20f93c28d57b3c7682185539ac55.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace Davy’s body parts with powerful Overtech gear to boost stats and unlock new Active and Passive Skills. Fight your way with endless build combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/d28720761d7be94776de4625aa91c44f.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/d28720761d7be94776de4625aa91c44f.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/d28720761d7be94776de4625aa91c44f.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/485207a30ab98e4f19b878fbbbed5daf.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash Davy’s imagination to temporarily transform reality and dramatically boost all of his abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/aba2263c15babcbea4d28612320d56dd.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/aba2263c15babcbea4d28612320d56dd.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/aba2263c15babcbea4d28612320d56dd.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/316cf17678c6185da563bfb1e500e970.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle classic monsters enhanced by Overtech, including werewolves, vampires, harpies, lizardmen, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons, armor, and abilities make every encounter fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/62ed2144d0d1eec29008c6394269a460.poster.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/62ed2144d0d1eec29008c6394269a460.webm?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/62ed2144d0d1eec29008c6394269a460.mp4?t=1792722824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/51dfcab5f9eb65ab044c99530c34783f.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1170 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486530/extras/3563014393ac36fcf16bbae79e646cf4.avif?t=1792722824\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Davy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weakest zombie in existence. Mocked by monsters and humans alike, he enters the dungeon to save Julia and prove himself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college student who died inside a shopping mall freezer during the Great War. Davy falls in love the moment he finds her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Frank</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brilliant but obsessive scientist who guides Davy’s journey while pursuing his own ambitions.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel corei5-8500 / AMD Ryzen 5 3500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 8 GB / RTX3050 8GB or AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 22 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 core / 12 threads (Intel Core i5 11600K | Ryzen 5 5600X)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 3060 8GB | Radeon RX 6600 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 22 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG"],"developers":["GPTRACK50 Inc."],"publishers":["GPTRACK50 Inc."],"release_date":"Oct 21, 2026"}